<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap stack gap-8">
    <div class="stack gap-3">
      <p class="eyebrow">02 — What the field does now</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.65rem;">Four idioms, and Starship shares our worst habit</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Twelve sites measured directly, not recalled. The dominant patterns are consistent enough to treat
        as a checklist — and the single closest competitor fails the same test we do.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="tbl-scroll">
      <table class="t">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Site</th><th>Hero</th><th>Nav</th><th>Reference at scale</th><th style="text-align:right;">Read</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>starship.rs</td>
            <td>Logo only. No screenshot of the prompt.</td>
            <td>One item: Configuration.</td>
            <td>~100 modules on one page + right TOC.</td>
            <td style="text-align:right;"><span class="verdict down">same trap</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>atuin.sh</td>
            <td>Animated terminal built in DOM. Buttons read <code>$ get-started</code>.</td>
            <td>History · AI · Blog · Docs.</td>
            <td>Docs on a subdomain, kept small.</td>
            <td style="text-align:right;"><span class="verdict up">closest model</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>bun.com</td>
            <td>Install box <em>is</em> the hero. Version in the button.</td>
            <td>Docs · Reference · Guides split.</td>
            <td>Generated reference as its own searchable app.</td>
            <td style="text-align:right;"><span class="verdict up">steal the split</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>zed.dev</td>
            <td>Product chrome re-rendered in DOM, real diagnostics as text.</td>
            <td>Extensions · Docs · Business · Pricing.</td>
            <td>Pushes settings into an in-app editor.</td>
            <td style="text-align:right;"><span class="verdict up">type as brand</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>tauri.app</td>
            <td>Nine-way package-manager tabbed install widget.</td>
            <td>Guides · References split.</td>
            <td>Card grid + platform facet + <code>Ctrl-K</code>.</td>
            <td style="text-align:right;"><span class="verdict up">best filter</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>biomejs.dev</td>
            <td>Logo, then a real rendered diagnostic block.</td>
            <td>Docs · Playground · Blog.</td>
            <td>511 rules split language × 9 groups, badge column.</td>
            <td style="text-align:right;"><span class="verdict up">best taxonomy</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>ray.so/themes</td>
            <td>—</td>
            <td>—</td>
            <td>Live DOM previews, <code>/{author}/{theme}</code> URLs, one-click apply.</td>
            <td style="text-align:right;"><span class="verdict up">gallery model</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>ghostty.org</td>
            <td>Client-rendered — served an empty <code>&lt;main&gt;</code> to a real browser.</td>
            <td>Docs · Discord · GitHub · Download.</td>
            <td>Hundreds of options on one page; docs admit it is unfit.</td>
            <td style="text-align:right;"><span class="verdict down">avoid</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>docs.astral.sh</td>
            <td>Docs <em>are</em> the homepage. Benchmark charts above the fold.</td>
            <td>Material sidebar.</td>
